# One line ending in the tree, on every platform. GitHub's Windows runners check
# out with core.autocrlf=true, which would turn goldens, workflow YAML and every
# fixture into CRLF: goldens then fail for checkout reasons, and Git Bash chokes
# on `$'\r'`. This is also what makes "shipped templates are identical bytes"
# true for anything read from disk.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never touched by line-ending conversion.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.pdf binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
